        {
          "claims": [],
          "text": "Each figure compares the start and end of the period. Prices may have fallen further in between and partly recovered."
        }
      ],
      "title": "What happened when markets panicked?"
    },
    {
      "id": "next",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "claims": [
            "next.correlation"
          ],
          "text": "Its correlation with the tracker was 0.12, measured on monthly returns in pounds from the end of Jan 2010 to the end of Sep 2026: 1 would mean always moving in step, 0 no pattern, and −1 always opposite."
        },
        {
          "claims": [
            "next.rolling_lowest",
            "next.rolling_highest"
          ],
          "text": "Measured over each 36-month stretch, it ranged from −0.55 (the 36 months to the end of Jan 2013) to 0.58 (the 36 months to the end of Jun 2024)."
        },
        {
          "claims": [],
          "text": "Correlation says how consistently the monthly moves lined up, not how big they were. A low figure is not protection."
        },
        {
          "claims": [
            "next.mix_annualised",
            "next.tracker_annualised"
          ],
          "text": "As an illustration, not a recommendation: from the end of Jan 2010 to the end of Sep 2026, a mix of 90% in the tracker and 10% in this investment, reset to 90/10 at the end of every December, returned 11.5% a year, against 12.5% a year for the tracker alone."
