            "next.mix_fall",
            "next.tracker_fall"
          ],
          "text": "The mix's volatility was 10.6% against the tracker's 11.7%, and its largest fall at month-end was 12.8% against 15.0%."
        },
        {
          "claims": [],
          "text": "Before fees, trading costs and tax."
        }
      ],
      "title": "What does it do next to the tracker?"
